# HANDOFF.md

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/images

# Accordion sample analysis (scratch research, not shipped app code) --
# ignore everything in the folder EXCEPT a small "lessons learned" bundle
# worth keeping in git history (general reusable findings, not tied to
# this app -- see the .md for why). Note: /accordion_analysis/* (not a
# bare /accordion_analysis/) is required for the negations below to work --
# git won't apply per-file exceptions inside a directory that's ignored
# wholesale.
/accordion_analysis/*
!/accordion_analysis/ACCORDION_REED_ACOUSTICS_NOTES.md
!/accordion_analysis/plot_musette_ideal_vs_real.png
!/accordion_analysis/plot_lowF3_weak_fundamental.png
!/accordion_analysis/plot_C4_registers.png